## Questions

{{if .ContactEmail}}Questions about this policy? Contact <{{.ContactEmail}}>.{{else}}Questions about this policy? See [SUPPORT.md]({{.SupportFile}}).{{end}}

{{- define "attitude" -}}
{{if eq . "encouraged"}}We actively encourage contributions made with AI/LLM assistance.{{else if eq . "allowed"}}Contributions made with AI/LLM assistance are welcome.{{else if eq . "neutral"}}We have taken no position on AI/LLM-assisted contributions — if in doubt, ask first.{{else if eq . "discouraged"}}We discourage AI/LLM-assisted contributions, though we do not prohibit them.{{else if eq . "prohibited"}}We do not accept AI/LLM-assisted contributions.{{else}}Our stance on AI/LLM-assisted contributions is: {{.}}.{{end}}
{{- end -}}

{{- define "autonomy" -}}
{{if eq . "any"}}Autonomous agents may act on this project’s behalf, including opening pull requests and issues with no human in the loop.{{else if eq . "assisted"}}A human must drive, review, and submit every contribution — no autonomous agents.{{else if eq . "none"}}No LLM involvement is permitted anywhere in the contribution process.{{else}}Permitted autonomy: {{.}}.{{end}}
{{- end -}}

{{- define "detail" -}}
{{if eq . "tool"}}the tool used, by name (Claude Code, Cursor, Amp …).{{else if eq . "extent"}}how much of the work the tool did.{{else if eq . "prompt"}}the prompt that produced the change.{{else}}{{.}}{{end}}
{{- end -}}

{{- define "obligation" -}}
{{if eq . "understand"}}**Understand it.** If you cannot explain the change, and how it meets the rest of the system, without the tool, do not submit it.{{else if eq . "review"}}**Review it yourself first.** Read every line before asking anyone else to.{{else if eq . "test"}}**Run it.** Code written for a platform you cannot exercise yourself is not tested, however correct it looks.{{else if eq . "edit"}}**Edit it down.** Generated text is verbose; trim it. Comments describing what the model did are noise to every future reader.{{else if eq . "human-reply"}}**Answer as a human.** Feedback from a human gets a reply from a human — never an automated one.{{else if eq . "license-cleared"}}**Clear the licence.** Do not include third-party code unless its licence permits this use and its terms are met.{{else if eq . "attest-original"}}**Attest it is yours.** Submitting the work states that it is your own creation, tool or no tool.{{else}}{{.}}{{end}}
{{- end -}}

{{- define "consequence" -}}
{{if eq . "warn"}}A first violation gets a warning.{{else if eq . "close"}}The contribution is closed without review.{{else if eq . "revoke"}}Commit or review privileges are withdrawn.{{else if eq . "ban"}}The account is barred from contributing again.{{else if eq . "publish"}}The violation is recorded on a public list.{{else}}{{.}}{{end}}
{{- end -}}

{{- define "use" -}}
{{if eq . "none"}}A human, with no AI involvement{{else if eq . "assisted"}}A human, with AI assistance{{else if eq . "any"}}May run autonomously{{else}}{{.}}{{end}}
{{- end -}}

